            "description": "Fix an integer $p\\ge2$. The public set $X\\subseteq\\mathbb R^d$ is nonempty compact convex with diameter at most D, and a feasible start x_0 is supplied. The operator is $C^{p-1}$ on an open neighborhood of X and satisfies $\\langle F(x)-F(y),x-y\\rangle\\ge\\mu\\|x-y\\|_2^2$ and $\\|D^{p-1}F(x)-D^{p-1}F(y)\\|_{\\rm op}\\le L_p\\|x-y\\|_2$ on X.",
