            "subject_id": "CV_S_STRONG_HIGH_VI_TANGENT__instance",
            "description": "The positive mu and L_p are lower and upper promises, not necessarily sharp moduli. No scalar potential or bound on lower derivatives is imposed. The unique VI solution need not be a zero of F, especially at the boundary. All norms are Euclidean induced multilinear operator norms.",
            "scope": "The domain stated in this clause."
          }
